    "disclosure": "AUTHORITY = NONE. Nothing in this programme confers constitutional force, ratifies a determination, or supersedes a canonical owner. Every binding is a pointer to an artifact that exists independently of this programme and remains owned by its own authority. The only facts this programme asserts are measured from Repository Truth at render time and are re-measurable by re-running the engine.",
