    "id": "UAEP-000001",
    "mission": "Bind every capability named in the Universal Autonomous Engineering Platform agreement to the canonical home that already realises it, so that the agreement lives in Repository Truth rather than in conversation. This programme creates no engine, no registry, no catalogue, no identity and no pipeline. Where a canonical owner already holds a capability it is bound by pointer; where the named capability has no single home it is declared a COMPOSE over homes that already exist; where the home exists under a different canonical name that difference is recorded rather than resolved by renaming.",
